<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">1 Korinthte</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korinthte</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Korinthte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian deihlama Jesu Khrist sawltak hi ding a sap leh i unaupa Sostheni in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Korinth khua a Pathian saptuam omte, Khrist Jesu a sehtuam siangthoute, misiangthou hi ding a sapte leh gamchih a i Toupa, amau leh eite Toupa, Jesu Khrist minlou tengteng kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a Pathian hehpihna noute kiang a hong kipiak ziak in na tungthu uah Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen gige hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkim ah thugen peuhmah ah leh theihna chiteng ah, amah a hihhauh in na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in Khrist thu ka theihsak pen noumau ah hihkip in a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huan i Toupa Jesu Khrist kilakna ngakkawm in, khalam thilpiak himhim na tasam kei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman i Toupa Jesu Khrist ni chiang a gensiat bei a na omna ding un, a tawppha in a hon hihkip behlap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A Tapa Jesu Khrist i Toupa toh kithuahna nei ding a nou honsam lutpa, Pathian a muanhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan unaute aw, na vek un thu kibang na gen ua, nalak ua kikhenna himhim a omlouhna ding in lungsim munkhat leh ngaihtuah munkhat a diktak a na kizop chinten zawkna ding un Toupa Jesu Khrist min in k’on ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka unaute aw, na tungtangthu uh, nalak uah kiselna a om chih Kloi inkuanpihte’n honhilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai ka chihna ahi, nou sung a mi tengteng in, “Kei Paul pawl ka hi,” “kei Apollos pawl ka hi,” “kei Kifa pawl ka hi,” “kei zaw Khrist pawl ka hi,” na chih uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist khenzak in a om ahia? Paul na sik un kilhden in a om ahia? Ahihkeileh Paul min a baptist in na om ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrispa leh Gaias loungal nalak uah mi kuamah k’on baptist louh ziak in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi hi kei leh zaw min keimah min a baptist na hi uh a chi kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Stephen inkuanpihte bel ka baptist ngei a, tuate louzaw midang ka baptist hia ka theikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khrist in baptist ding in a honsawl kei a, Tanchinhoih gen ding in a honsawl ahi; thupil a genlou in, huchilou in zaw Khrist Kros thilhihtheihna bangmahlou a suaksak kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kros thu zaw mangthang lelte adin haina ahi ngal a; ei hotdam lelte adin bel Pathian thilhihtheihna ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mi pil pilna ka hihmang ding a, lemthei lemtheihna leng ka paikhe ding” chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi pil koi ah ahia? Laigelhmi koi ah ahia? Hiai khovel a selhatmi koi ah ahia? Pathian in khovel pilna haihuai ahi chih a theisak kei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian pilna ah bel, khovel in a pilna zang a Pathian a theihtheih louh nung in thugen haihuai zang a a gingtate hotdam a kipahlam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Judate’n chiamtehnate a phut ua, Grikte’n pilna’n a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eite’n bel Khrist kilhden thu i gen ua; huai tuh Judate adin pukna, Jentelte adin haina ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Himahleh Judate leng hi hen aw, Grikte leng hi heh, sapte adin zaw Khrist, Pathian thilhihtheihna leh Pathian pilna pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian haina mihing sang in a pilzaw a, Pathian hatlouhna leng mihing sang in a hatzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute aw, a hon sapna ngaihtuah dih ua, salam a mi pil tampite, mi hat tampite, mi hoih pipite, sap a hihlouh dan uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in khovel thilhaite a tel a, mipilte a zahlaksak theihna ding in; huan Pathian in khovel thilhatloute a tel a, a hatte a zahlak sak theihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khovel thil niam leh thil siammawhhuaite, thil omloute tan in Pathian in a tel a, thil omte bangmahloua a bawl theihna ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian ma ah mi kuamah a kiuangsak theikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah Khrist a noute hinna nak ahi; Pathian in Khrist i pilna, i diktatna, i sianthouna leh i tatna hi ding in a bawlta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huaiziak in gelh a hih bang in, “A suang peuhmah in Toupa suang hen.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, Pathian thuguk nou honhilh ding a na kiang ua ka honglai in thugen thupi leh pilna thupi toh ka hongpai kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu Khrist, amah mah kilhden a om thu kia loungal nalak uah bangmah theih ka tum kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatlou leh lau in, nakpitak a ling kawm in nalak uah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka paukam suak leh ka thugente thupil a khemna thu ahi kei a, Kha leh thilhihtheihna theihsakna in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi a na ginna uh mihing pilna a kingalou a, Pathian thilhihtheihna a kinga a a om theihzawkna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh pichingte lak ah ahihleh thupil i hilh zel a, himahleh hiai khovel thupil zaw ahi kei; hiai khovel vaihawmte mangthang dingte thupil leng ahi sam kei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian pilna guk leh kisel, i thupina ding a Pathian in khovel omma a a sehkholhsa pen i hilh zawnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai khovel vaihawmte himhim in a theikei uhi; thei le uzaw thupina Toupa kilhden lou ding hi ve un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mit a muh ngeilouh, bil a zak ngeilouh, mihing lungtang a lut ngeilou, Pathian in amah itte adia a bawl,” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in Kha in huaite ei a hon theisakta hi; Kha in bangkim Pathian thugilte leng a suikhe vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing ngaihtuahte mihing lungsim asung a om mah lou in, kuan ahia thei ding? Huchi mah bang in Pathian ngaihtuahte Pathian Kha mah lou kuamah in a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan a thawn a Pathian in thil honpiakte i theihna ding in, eite’n zaw khovel kha hilou in, Kha, Pathian a kipan ngei i mu zaw uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing pilna a sinsak thute a hilhlou in Kha sinsak in i hilhzaw ua, Kha neite kiang ah khalam thutakte i hilhchian uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khovel min Pathian Kha thilpiakte a sang kei nak hi, amah ngaihdan in haihuai ahi ngal a, kha a theihchet a hih ziak in a theithei kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khami in bel thil bangkim a chian zel a, amah lah kuamah in a chian kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kuan ahia Toupa lungsim theikhin a, amah thuhilh thei ding?” Eite’n bel Khrist lungsim i pu uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, kha mite kiang a gen bang in na kiang uah thu ka gen theikei hi; samite, Khrist a naungekte kiang a gen bang in ka genzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An gum na nektheih nailouh ziak un, nawitui in ka honvak a, tua an gum hi tuin leng na nethei naikei lailai uh, sami na hihlai ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nalak uah kihazatna leh kiselna a om nak ziak in sa mi hilai in mihing bang a omlai hilou na hi u hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi khat in “Paul pawl ka hi,” midang in, “Kei zaw Apollos pawl ka hi,” na chih laiteng uh mihing lel hilai hilou na hi uhiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Apollos kua ahia leh? Paul leng kua ahia? Nasemmi, noumau hon gingta sakmi lel eive ua, huai leng Toupa’n a piak bangzel in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ken ka suan a, Apollos in tui in a vak a, himahleh Pathian in a khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in a khangsakpa Pathian kia loungal, a suanpa lah bangmah ahi kei a, tui a vakpa leng bangmah ahi tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan a suanpa leh tui a vakpa pumkhat ahi ua, himahleh amau sepgim bangzel in, amau kipahman a mu tuaktuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koute Pathian na seppihte ka hi ua, noute Pathian louma na hi ua, Pathian inlam leng na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in hehpihna honpiak bangzel in inlam heutupen piltak bang in ken suangphum ka lem a, midang in a tung ah inn a lam uhi. Himahleh michih a tung a a lamdan ding uah pilvang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suangphum lepkhitsa loungal suangphum dang kuamah in a lem theita kei ua, huai suangphum Jesu Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai suangphum tung ah kuapeuh in dangkaeng in hiam, dangkain hiam, suang mantamin hiam, singin hiam, loupain hiam, buhpawl hiam inn lam leh; chetna ni tungding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Michih nasep a honglang ding hi; ni in a hihlang ding ahi ngal a, mei a a kilak ding ziak in; mei ngeingei in michih nasep bangchibang ahia chih a enchian ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kua nasep leng a tung a a lampen a om gige leh huai mi in kipahman a mu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kua nasep leng a kat leh huai mi in a tan ding hi; amah taktak zaw mei a paisuak bang in hotdam in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian tempul na hih uh leh Pathian Kha noumau sung ah a teng gige chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kuapeuh in Pathian tempula hihsiat leh Pathian in huai mi a hihse ding; Pathian tempula siangthou ngal a, huai tempul noumau na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuamah amah leh amah kikhem kei hen. Nalak ua kuapeuh hiai khovel a pil a kisak leh, a hongpil theihna ding in mihai hongsuak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai khovel pilna Pathian ngaihdan in haina ahi. “Aman amaute a pil lepchiahna uah a man hi” chih gelh ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n mipilte ngaihtuahna a thawn ahi" chih a thei chi a gelh ahi nawnlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuamah in mihingte suang kei uhen; bangkim nou a ahi vekta ngal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul hiam, Apollos hiam, Kifa hiam, khovel hiam, hinna hiam, sihna hiam, thil omsa hiam, thil hongom ding hiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Avek in nou a ahivek hi; noumau leng Khrist a na hi ua; Khrist leng Pathian a ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koute zaw Khrist nasemte leh Pathian thuguk kemte bang in min hon thei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai ah kempa mi muanhuai hih a kiphamoh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh nou n’on ze-etna ua leh mihing ngaihtuahna in n’on ze-etna uh kei ading in thil neuchik ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keimah leng ka ki ze-et ngei tuankei. Bangmah kimawhsakna ding ka kithei kei a; himahleh huai in siam hon tangsak tuankei hi; hon ze-etpa Toupa ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in a hun ma in bangmah ze-et kei un, Toupa hongpai masiah, aman mial a thil selgukte vak ah a hon lakhe ding hi; lungtang a tupte leng a hihlang lai ding hi; huai hun chiang in michih in Pathian a kipan in amau tan hun chiat in phatna a loh chiat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unaute aw, na phattuampihna ding un hiai thu Apollos leh kei tung ah ka belh hi, huchi a koute a kipan a hindan na sin theihna ding uleh, a kigelhsa pen sang a na lak ua kuamah mi khat midang sang a ngaina zaw a na kisaktheihpih louhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuan ahia nou a thiltuam deuh om a mu? Na muhsawn louh ngal uh bang ahia na neih uh? Huchi a a musawn lel na hih uleh na muhsawn uh a thawn a piak hilou bang a bangdia kisathei zenzen?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin na vahta ua! Tuin na hong hauta ua! Kou lou in vai na hawmta uhi! Ahi, vaihawm taktak le uchin ka vaihawm sam theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in kou sawltakte, si ding a sehsa bang in a nanungpen in hon sepkhia hi in ka thei ahi; khovelte leh angelte leh mihingte mitmuh a etnop a bawl in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kou zaw Khrist ziak in mihai ka hi ua, nou bel Khrist ah mi pil na hi zaw uhi; kou zaw ka hatkei ua, nou bel na hat uhi; nou zaw mi pahtawi in na om ua, kou zaw mi simmawh in ka omzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tutan in leng ka gilkial un ka dangtak ua, puansilh ka kiching kei ua, mi khutthak nuhna ka hi ua, mun leh mual ka neikei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koumau khut a sem in ka gim mahmah uhi; min hontai uleh ka vualzawl ua; a honsawi uleh ka thuak teitei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Min hon gensiat uleh ka khem ua; tutan in leng khovel ninnok thil tengteng nin kihhuai bang in a honbawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na zumna ding un hiai thu ka gelh ahi kei a, ka ta deihtakte bang a hon taihilh ding in ka gelh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrist ah heutu sing khat nei mahle uchin, pa zaw tampi na nei tuankei uhi. Ken Khrist Jesu ah Tanchinhoih in noute k’on neikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka omdan zui ding in k’on ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiaiziakin Timothi, Toupa a ka ta deihtak leh muanhuai, na kiang uah k’on sawl hi. Aman Khrist a ka omdan, gamchih a saptuamte teng thu ka hilh zel dan noute a hon theisak nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huan kei na kiang ua hong nawnlou ding bang zen in khenkhat nana kiuangsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa’n pha a sakleh sawtlou chik nung in na kiang uah ka hongding, huchi in mi kiuangsakte kamhat thu hilou in, a thilhihtheihna uh ka thei zawta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian gam zaw kamhat thu ah a omkei a, thilhihtheihna ah a omzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bang na deihzaw ua? Sikchiang toh hia, itna leh kingaihniamna lungsim toh na kiang ua ka hongding?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nalak uah kingaihna nin a om chih thu a thang vengvung hi. Huchibang kingaihna nin Jentelte lak a leng om ngeilou, nalak ua mi khat in amah pa zi a kitenpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai thilhihpa nalak ua kipan delhkhiak ding a lungngaih naksang in na kisaktheih pih zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei mahmah sapum in ka pang kei na a, kha in noute lak ah ka om a, thil huchitel hihpa tuin leng Toupa Jesu min in nalak ua pang bang a kingaihtuah in thupukna ka bawlta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist min a na kikhop chiang un, noute lak ah kha in ka om a, Toupa Jesu Khrist thilhihtheihna leng a om hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi huchibang zaw a kha Toupa ni chiang a hotdam a a om theihna ding in a sa hihmang ding in Setan kiang ah pia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kisaktheihna uh hoihlou ahi. Silngou tawmchik in tanghou beu a pum in a zelsuak chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Silngou panglou na hih mah bang un tanghou beu thak na hong hihtheihna ding un silngou luipen pai khesiang un. I Paikan Ankuangluina ding Khrist latkhiakin a omta hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaiziak in Ankuanglui ni, silngou lui a Ankuang lui lou in, nunsia leh gitlouhna silngou a leng Ankuanglui samlou in, takna leh thutak tanghou silngou sohlouhin Ankuang i lui zaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka laikhak ah kingaihhatte kithuahpih lou ding in na kiang uah ka gelh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai khovel a kingaihhatte hiam, huaiham leh lepgute hiam, milimbete hiam kithuahpih hetlouh ding chi ka hi kei a; huchibang hileh khovel a kipan na paikhiak uh kul ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tun bel kuapeuh unau min paw ngal in, kingaihhatmi hiam, mi huaiham hiam, milim bemi hiam, hanhatmi hiam, zukham hatmi hiam, lepgumi hiam hileh, kithuahpih lou ding in na kiang uah ka gelh ahi; mi huchibang kiang ah nek leng ne kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawlam mite tung a vaihawm ding ken bang ahia ka awlmoh ding om? Nou sung a mite hilou hia na ngaihtuah ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawlam a mite tung a Pathian in vaihawm hilou hia? “Huai migiloupa na lak ua kipan koihmang un.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na lak uah kuapeuh in midang toh thubuai neita le uchin, misiangthoute ma a tunlou in, mi diktatloute ma ah na tun ngam ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihleh misiangthoute’n khovel tung a vaihawm ding ahi chih na theikei ua hia? Khovel mite tung a bawn vaihawm ding na hih uleh, thil neupente leng ngaihtuah taklou na hi ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tulai damsung thute genlouh angelte nangawn i vaihawm ding uh ahi chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in tulai damsung thute ngaihtuah ding na neih un bangdia saptuamte ngaihniam pente ngaihtuah sak na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na zumna ding un ka gen ahi. A unaute kal a thu hihpuk thei mi pil, khat bek na lak uah na mu kei ua ading maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Unau in a unau mah ginglou mite vaihawmna a a tut zawk nak!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hilou ahi, hiai na diklouhna khat uh ahipah hi, thubuai na kineih tuah nak uh. Bangdia dikloupi a hihna na thuak zaw lou? Bang a chia kizangsak zaw mailou oi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hilou ahi, noumau ngei in na unaute uh tung ah leng na hihdik kei ua, na zangsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihleh midiktatloute’n Pathian gam a luah kei ding uh chih na theikei ua hia? Zekhem in omkei un, kingaihhatte, milim bete, angkawmte leh mihukte leh tokawhukte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gutate, mihuaihamte, zukhamhatte, salhhatte leh lepgute’n Pathian gam a luah kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan noute khenkhat huchibang na hi uhi; himahleh Toupa Jesu Khrist min in leh i Pathian Kha ah siansak na hita ua, hihsiangthou na hita uh, siamtang na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Thil bangkim hih kei ding in a sianga” himahleh thil bangkim hih a hoihkim kei hi; “Thil bangkim hih kei ding in a sianga” himahleh bangmah sikha din ka kiphal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Nek dingte gilpi a ahi a, gilpi leng nek ding a ahi” himahleh Pathian in ahihmang tuaktuak ding. Huan sapum pen kingaihna ding ahi kei a, Toupa ading ahi; Toupa leng sapum ading ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in misi lak a kipan Toupa a kaithou a, eite leng a thilhihtheihna in a hon kaithou sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na sapum uh Khrist hiang ahi chih na theikei ua hia? Khrist hiangte laksak in kizuak hiang ding peuh in ka bawl dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bawllou hial ding. Ahihleh kizuak zop amah toh pumkhat ahi uh chih na theikei ua hia? “A nihun sa pumkhat a hi ding uh” a chi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa zop bel amah toh kha pumkhat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kingaih taisanun. Mihing thil hihkhelh chiteng sapum pawlam ah ahi; mingaihhat in bel amah sapum tung ah thil a hihkhial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihleh na sapum uh, na sungua om Pathian kiang a kipan a na muh uh, Kha Siangthou tempul ahi chih na theikei ua hia? Noumaua leng na hi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noute man a leisa na hihman un, na pumpi uh leh na kha Pathiana mah in, Pathian pahtawi un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin, na thilgelh thute uzaw: “Pasal ading in numei khoih louh a hoih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh kingaihna a om nak ziak in pasal chih in amah zi chiat nei henla, numei chih in leng amah pasal chiat nei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal in a zi kiang ah a tan ding hun pia hen; huchi mah bang in zi in leng a pasal kiang ah a tan ding hun pe sam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zi in amah sapum tung ah thu a neikei a, a pasal in thu a nei zaw hi; huchi mah bang in pasal in leng amah sapum tung ah thu a neikei a, a zi in thu a nei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thum ding a na kipiak theihna ding uleh, na kikholh nawn theihna ding ua sawtlou kal a dia pha nasak tuaktuak kei ngal uleh a kuamahmah kizangsak kei un, huchilou in zaw na kidek zohlouh ziak un Setan in a honkhem kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh hiai thu thupiak dan hilou in phal lam thu in ka genzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken bel, mi tengteng keimah bang a a omvek uh ka deih ahi. Himahleh michih in Pathian a kipan thilpiak amau muh lam, khat in lam tuam in khat in lam dang in a neichiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh lengkulte leh meithaite kiang ah huchi in ka chi ahi: Keimah bangtak in om le uh amau din a hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kidektheihna a neihkei ua leh kiteng u hen; huk sang in kiten a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan kitengsate kiang ah thu ka pia, keimah bel hilou in, Toupa piak ahizaw; Zi in a pasal khen kei hen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khen vanglak leh pasal nei nawnlou in om vanglak hen, ahihkeileh, a pasal toh mah kituak nawn uheh; huan pasal in a zi ma kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang kiang ah ahihleh Toupa hilou in keimah in ka gen: Unau kuapeuh in zi, gingloumi kitenpih leh a kiang a om gige a ut leh, ma kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan numei pasal ginglou kitenpih in, a pasal in a kiang a om gige a ut leh ma kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal gingloumi a zi ziak in hihsiangthou in a om a, zi gingloumi leng a pasal ziak in hihsiangthou in a omsam ahi; huchi hita kei leh, na tate uh a siangthou kei ding uhi; himahleh a siangthou na uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh a ginglou pen in a khen leh khen mai hen, huchibang ah zaw unaupa hiam, unaunu hiam, hen ahita kei ding. Pathian in lemna ah a honsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zi aw, na pasal na hotdam ding leh ding louh bangchi’n na thei a eita? Pasal aw, na zi na hotdam ding leh ding louh bangchi’n na thei a eita?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa’n michih kiang a a piak bang chiat leh Pathian in michih a saplaia a omdan bangchiatin om hen. Huchibang in saptuam pawl tengteng ah ka hihkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeksumsa a sapa om uhia? Zeksumlouh honghi tuankei uhen. Zeksumlouh a om sap a om uhia? Zeksum tuan dah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian thupiakte zuih lel louh ngal zeksum i chih bangmah ahi kei a, zeksum louh leng bangmah ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Michih sapa a omlai ua a tan ngeina uah om chiat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikha hisa a sap na hi hia? Khawksa tuan ken. Na suahtak theih leh sensukin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikha hisa a om Toupa sap Toupa sikha noplen ahi a; huchi mah bang in noplen sa a sap Khrist sikha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Man a lei na hita ua mihingte sikha ah lut kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Unaute aw, michih sapa a omlai bangbang in Pathian kiang ah om gige hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan nungak siangthou lam thu ah zaw Toupa thupiak himhim ka neikei; himahleh muanhuai a om ding in Toupa kiang a kipan zahngaihna mu ka hih ziak in ka ngaihtuah dan ka gen ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tulai haksatna ziak in pasal a omdan ngeingei bang in om leh amah ading in hoih in ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zi a hen na hi hia? Kisutkhiak tum ken. Zi a henlouh na hi hia? Zi zong ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh zi na neih leh thil na hihkhial kei hi, nungak siangthou in leng pasal a neih leh thil a hihkhial sam kei hi. Himahleh, hichibang mite’n sa ah gimna a thuak ding uhi; himahleh ken zaw hon thuaksak louh ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, hiai ka chi ahi: hunseh a tomta; zi neite neilou bang a a om theihna ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kapte kap lou bang a a om theihna ding un leh kipakte kipaklou bang a a om theihna ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khovel zangte zang law zen lou a a om theihna ding un: hiai khovel omdan lah a mangthang gige ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lungzinna neilou a na om uh k’on deih hi. Zi neilou pasal in Toupa lungkimsakna ding in, Toupa lam thilte a limsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zinei pasal in bel a zi lungkimsakna ding in, khovel thilte a limsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasal neisa leh nungak siangthou kilamdanna a om hi. Pasal neilou numei in a sapum leh Kha Siangthou ding dan, Toupa lam thilte a limsak a; pasalnei numei in bel a pasal lungkimsak ding dan, khovel lam thilte a limsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nou phattuamna ding in hiai ka gen ahi; na tung ua khamna nga hilou in, navak a na omna ding uleh Toupa kiang a na kipiakna uh bukimna ding in ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kuapeuh in a zikham tung a gamta diklou hi a a kigintak a, a lunggulhna a let ngal a a kul leh, hoih a sak bang in hih hen aw: kiteng uhen, khelhna ahi kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh a lungtang a thukhensat a, a loutheilou khop a kulna nei hilou a, amah kithuzohmi in a siangthouna kepbit a tup chinten leh a hih hoih ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huchi in nungak kitenpih pa’n a hih hoih a; himahleh Zi neilou dia amah kikham in a hih hoih zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zi zaw a pasal a dam laiteng hen ahi; himahleh a pasal a sih a leh a deih peuh a nei thei ding a, himahleh Toupa a om mi ahi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Himahleh kei ngaihdan in, a om ngei in om gige leh nuam a sa zaw ding; ken Pathian Kha neisam in ka kithei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin milimte kiang a kithoihna tungtang zaw: I vek un theihna i neichiat uh, chih i kithei hi. Theihna in mi a kisathei sak a itna in mi a bawl hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuapeuh in thil banghiam thei a a kingaihtuah leh, a theih ding thei nailou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh mi kuapeuh in Pathian a it leh, huai mi mah amah theih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in milimte kiang a kithoihna thilnek thu zaw, “Khovel ah milim himhim bangmah a hih louh dan uleh, khat kia loungal Pathian dang himhim a omlouh dan i thei uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van ah leh lei ah pathian minpu tampi om mahle uh, huchibang pathian tampi leh toupa tampi a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite ading in bel Pathian khat kia Pa, a om a amah kiang a kipan in bangkim a pawt a, eite leng amah adia om i hi uhi. Toupa khat kia, Jesu Khrist a om hi, Amah ziak in bangkim a om hi, eite leng amah ziak mah a om i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh huai theihna mi tengteng ah a omkei hi; khenkhatte milim biakna sa a hih ziak un, milim kiang a kithoihna ahi chih thei napi in tutan in a ne uhi; huchi in a sialehpha theihna uh a hatlouh ziak in a thanghuaisak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh, sanek in Pathian mit hon tungsak tuankei ding a, ne keimah lehang i se tuankei a, ne mah lehang leng i hoih tuan sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh pilvang un, huchilou in zaw na noplenna uh bang chichi hiam in mihatloute adin pukna a honghi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang theihna neimi, kuapeuh in milim biakna in a Ankuang um a a honmuh ngal un, amau mihatlou na hita le uh milim kiang a kithoihna thil ne ding in a sialehpha theihna hong maingal lou ding hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in na theihna ziak in unau hatlou, a sih sik a Khrist in a sihsakpa, a mangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute tung a huchibang thil na hihkhelh ua, a sialehpha theihna uh a hatlouh naklai a na liamsak behlap un, Khrist tung ah thil na hihkhial uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak tak in ka sa nek in ka unau a hihpuk sang in, ka unau ka hihpuk louhna ding in kumtawn in sa himhim ka neta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noplen ka hi ka hia? Sawltak ka hi ka hia? I Toupa Jesu ka muta ka hia? Noute Toupa a ka nasep gah na hi kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi dangte adin sawltak hi keimah leng, nou ading bek in zaw ka hi; Toupa a ka sawltak hihna chiamtehna noumau na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hiai kei hondemte ka dawn na ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ne ding leh dawn ding in thu ka neikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltak dangte leh Toupa unaute leh Kifa bang in zi gingtami pi vialvial ding in thu ka neikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihkeileh kei leh Barnaba kia koumau kivak kawm a khut a nasem lou ding in thu ka neilou tuam ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaih kua ahia amah kivak a galkap ngei? Kuan ahia a gah ne lou a grephuan bawl ngei? Ahihkeileh kuan ahia ganhon nawitui nelou a ganhon vul ngei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai thute mihing bang mai in ka gen ahia? Danthu mah in leng huai ngei a gen sam ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosi dan Laibu ah, “Bawngtal in buh a chillai in a muk gak ken” chih gelh ahi. Pathian in bawngtal ading kia hia a ngaihtuah sak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahihkeileh ei ading a kigen ahi hia? Hi e, ei ading a a gelh ahi; Leiletpa’n lamet nei a leh ding ahi a, buhvawpa’n leng tanneih sam lamen in a vuak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koute’n khalam thilte na kiang ua ka tuh ngal uleh, na salam thilte uh at le ung leng thil thupi ahi dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang in bawn na tung ua thuneihna a tan uleh kou tang sem lou ding ka hi uh maw? Himahleh huai thuneihna ka zang kei uh; Khrist Tanchinhoih ka dallouhna ding un bangkim ka thuak teitei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempula thiltan bawl vialvialte’n Pathian biakin a kipan nek a mu ua, maitam a nasemte’n maitam apan a ne uh chih na theikei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in, Toupa’n Tanchinhoih gente nek muhna ding in Tanchinhoih mah a sep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh ken zaw tuate khat leng ka zang kei hi; ka tung a hiaite na hih ding uh ahi chi a hiai thu gelh ka hi kei hi. Kuapeuh in ka suanpen bangmahlou a a bawl sang un, si mai leng kei ading in a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tanchinhoih gen mah leng kisaktheihna ding ahi kei hi. Hihlouh theihlouh ka tung ah a kinga ahi; Tanchinhoih gen keileng ka tung gik ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai tuh keimah utthu a hih hileng kipahman ka nei hi; himahleh, keimah utthu ahihkei leh Tanchinhoih kepna nna piak a om ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kipahman bang ahia leh? Tanchinhoih ka gen in loh neilou a, Tanchinhoih a thawn a pia ka hihtheihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kuamah sikha hi kei mah leng, mi tamsem ka lak theihna ding in mi tengteng sikha in ka kibawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in Judate ka laklut theihna ding in Judate kiang ah Judami bang in ka om zel; dan nuai a omte ka laklut theihna ding in dan nuai a omte kiang ah dan nuai a om bang in ka om zel, dan nuai a om tuanlou in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan neiloute ka laklut theihna ding in dan neiloute kiang ah dan neilou bang in ka om zel, Pathian dan a omlou tuanlou in, Khrist dan zawm ngal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatloute ka laklut theihna ding in hatloute kiang ah hatlou bang in ka om zel; hihtheihna teng zang a khenkhatte ka hotdam theihna ding in mi tengteng kiang ah bangkim ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tanchinhoih ziak in bangkim ka hih zel a, a vualzawlnate ka tansam theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kitaitehte avek un a tai ua, himahleh khat kia in kipahman a mu zel chih na theikei ua hia? Na muhtheihna ding un huchi mah bang in tai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huan kidemna a kimawlmi peuhmah bangkim ah mahni kithunun in a om nak uhi. Amau zaw lallukhu sethei mu ding in a hih ua, eite’n bel lallukhu setheilou mu ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in kei ka tai a, a ziak bei hilou in; huihkhua leltak nawhlou in, ka pang hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka sapum ka hih sidup a; sikha in ka bawl zawzel hi; huchilou in zaw midangte kiang a ka tangkoupih nung in leng bangchi hiam in keimah tak kipahman mutaklou a in ka om kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute aw, hiaite na theihlouh uh ka deihkei, huchi a i pipute tengteng mei nuai a a omvek ua, avek ua tuipi leng a kan ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Avek ua mei leh tuipi a Mosi a baptist lut a a omvek ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Avek ua khalam an kibang a nek chiat ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Avek ua khalam dawn ding kibang a dawn chiat uhi. Amaute zui, khalam Suangpi apan a dawn chiat ngal ua; huai Suangpi Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh a lak ua mi tamzaw tung ah Pathian a lunghita kei a; gamdai ah a puklum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan huai thilte ei ding a etton ding ahi, thil gilou a lunggulh bang ua i lunggulh sam louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lak ua khenkhat milim bemi a hihbang un milim bemi hi kei un. “Mipite ne ding leh dawn ding in a tu ua, lam ding in ading nawn chiat uh” chih gelh bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lak ua khenkhat in nungak a ngai ua, ni khat in sing nih leh sang thum in a puklup loh bang un, i kingai sam kei ding uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lak ua khenkhat in Toupa a ze-et ua, gul a hihman a a om bang un, Toupa zaw i ze-et kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lak ua khenkhat a phun ua, hihmangthangpa hih manthat a a om bang un, phun sam kei ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan, huaite vaukholhna ding in a tung uah a hongtung hi; eite, hun tawp hong tunnate, hon thuhilhna ding a leng gelh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in ding a kingaihtuah pilvang hen, huchilou in zaw a pukkha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing thuaktheih val khemna himhim na tuang uah a tung ngeikei hi. Pathian zaw a muanhuai hi, aman na thuaktheih val uh khemna na tuah uh a phalkei ding; na thuaktheihna ding un khemna peuh ah taikhiakna lampi a bawl zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka deihtakte aw, milim biak taisan un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipilte kiang a gen bang a ka thugente ngaihtuah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vualzawlna nou a k’on vualzawl uh, Khrist sisan kikoppihna ahi ka hia? Tanghou ka balkhap uh Khrist pumpi kikoppihna ahi ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eite mi tampi tanghou beukhat, pumkhat i hi uhi; i vek un tanghou beu khat ah i tangchiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Salam a Israelte en dih ua; kithoihna sa nete’n maitam thilte a kikoppih kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bang ka genna ahia le? Milim lak a kithoihna leh milim leng banghiam tak ahi chih ka genna hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jentelte kithoihna, Pathian lak ah hilou in dawite lak ah a kithoih uh ahi chih ka genzaw ahi; noute zaw dawite toh na kithuah uh hon deihlou ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa nou leh dawi nou na dawn khawm theikei ding uh; Toupa dohkan leh dawi dohkan ah na nekhawm thei sam kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihkeileh Toupa hazatna tohthoh i tum uh ahi maw? Amah sang in i hatzaw ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thil bangkim hih a sianga” himahleh thil bangkim hih a hoihkei hi. “Thil bangkim hih a sianga” himahleh thil bangkim hih in mi a bawlhoih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kuapeuh in amah hoihna ding zong lou in midang hoihna ding zongzaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sa dawla a zuak peuhmah uh na sia leh phatheihna ziak un bangmah donglou in ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Lei leh asung a tengteng Toupa a ahi ngal a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ginglou mi lak a kuahiam in nou honsap a, hoh na ut ngal un, sialehpha theihna ziak ua bangmah donglou in, a hon lui peuh uh ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh kuahiam in “Hiai zaw kithoihna ahi chi a a honhilh leh sialehpha theihna ziak leh nou a hon hilhpa ziak in nekei un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmah sialehpha theihna ka chi kei a, amah sialehpha theihna pen ahi ka chih zawk. Bang a chia midang sia leh phatheihna in ka noplenna thunun ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kipaktak a ka tan leh a tung a kipahthu ka genna tung ah bang ding a gensiat a om ka hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in na nek uhiam na dawn uhiam, na hihpeuhmah uh, Pathian thupina ding ngen in hih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judate ding hiam, Grikte ding hiam, Pathian saptuamte ding hiam in a pukna ding uh bangmah hih kei un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ken keimah phattuamna zong lou a, hotdam a hihtheihna ding ua mi tampi phattuamna zong a, mi tengteng bangkim a ka kipahsak bang in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hon enzuite hi un, keileng Khrist enzuipa ka hih mah bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan bangkim a n’on theihgige ziak un leh thukhah k’on hilh bang a na vom chinten ziak un k’on phat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh pasal peuhmah lutang Khrist ahi, numei lutang pasal ahi, Khrist lutang Pathian ahi chih na theih uh ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasal a lu khuhkawm a thum hiam, thugen hiam peuhmah in, a lu a selphou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh numei a lu khuhlou a thum hiam, thugen hiam peuhmah in a lu a selphou ahi; metmai toh kibang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Numei a lu khuhlou a a om ngal leh met vanglak hen. Himahleh, numei ading a sam met leh metmai a zumhuai leh a lu khuh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasal zaw Pathian batpih leh thupina a hih ziak in a lu a khuh ding hilou himhim ahi; numei bel pasal thupina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasal numei a kipan a pawt ahi kei a; numei bel pasal a kipan a pawt ahizaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasal numei adia siam ahi kei a; numei bel pasal adia siam ahizaw hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in, angelte ziak in numei in pasal thuneihna chiamtehna a khuk ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa thilgel dan ah, numei pasal lou in a om theikei a, pasal leng numei lou in a om thei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numei pasal a kipan a pawt a hih bang in, pasal leng numei lak a piang ahi ngal a; himahleh bangkim Pathian a kipan a pawt vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noumau kingaihtuah dih ua, numei in a lu khuhlou a Pathian kiang a thum a kilawm hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasal in samsau a neih leh amah ading in a zumhuai ahi chih na lungtang pianpih un leng a hon theisak kei ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numei in bel samsau a neih leh amah ding in thupina ahizaw; a sam khuhna ding a piak a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh mi kuahiam hiai thu a a genhak leh huchibang paidan himhim i neikei uh, Pathian saptuam pawlte’n leng a neisam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh nou hiai thu k’on hilhna ah k’on phat theikei, na hoihsemna ding uh hilou in, na siatsemna ding ua na kikhop nak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A masapen in saptuamte na kikhop un, nalak uah kilangkhenna a om chih ka za a; gin leng ka gingta sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nalak ua a taktakte a lattheihna ding un, nalak ua gintuamna leng a omsam ding him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na hong kikhop ua na nekkhawm uh Toupa Nitakan ahi kei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Michih in na nek chiang un noumau nitakan na ne masa zel ngal ua; huchi in mi khat gil a kial a, a dang in a kham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangchidan ahia? Nek leh dawnna ding inn na neikei ua hia? Ahihkeileh Pathian saptuamte musit in, bangmah neiloute na selphou ua hia? Na kiang uah bang ka genta dia? K’on phat dia hia? Hiai lam thu ah k’on phat theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka thu honhilh sawn Toupa kiang a kipan a ka muh ahi a, huchi a Toupa Jesu’n matsak a a om zan a, tanghou a lak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kipahthu a genkhit a a balkhap a, “Hiai ka pumpi nou adia piak ahi, Keimah theihgigena in hiai hih zel un,” a chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi mah bang a nitakan a nekkhit a nou leng a lak a, “Hiai nou ka sisan a thukhun thak ahi, na dawn teng un keimah theihgigena in hih zel un,” a chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai tanghou na nek ua, nou na dawn teng un a hongpai nawn masiah, Toupa sihna na phuangzak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuapeuh kilawmloutak a tanghou ne hiam, Toupa nou dawn hiam in Toupa sapum leh sisan tung ah siamlouh a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in michih amah ki enchian zaw hen, huchibang in tanghou ne in nou dawn hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ne leh dawn in Toupa pumpi ngenteltak a a ngaihtuah kei leh amah tung a vaihawmna ding in a ne in a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hiaiziakin nalak ua mi tampi na hatkei ua, na zawngkhal uhi, tampi’n na sih loh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Himahleh ngenteltak in eimah kingaihtuah zel lehang, vaihawmsak a om naklou ding i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Himahleh vaihawmsak a i om in leng khovel toh siamlouhtang a i omlouhna ding in Toupa taihilh in i om zel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka unaute aw, ne ding a na kikhop un kingak chiat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na kikhop uh vaihawmna na thuakpihlouhna ding un, kuapeuh in a gil a kial leh a in lam ah ne masa hen. Huan thu dang zaw ka hongpai chiang in ka bawllem ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin unaute aw, khalam thilpiak thute na theihlouh uh ka ut kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jentelte na hihlai un bangchidan peuh a honpi lai un leng, huai milim pautheiloute lam ah pimang in na om uh chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuamah in, Pathian Kha a thugen in, “Jesu hamsiat in om hen” a chi ngeikei. Huan kuamah in, Kha Siangthou kia loungal in, “Jesu Toupa ahi” a chi ngeikei uh chih k’on theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan thilpiak tuamtuam a om a, Kha bel kikhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nasepna tuamtuam leng a om, himahleh Toupa khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nasepsakna tuamtuam leng a om, himahleh Pathian khat ahi, mi tengteng a bangkim sempa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Kha theihsakna michih kiphattuampih chiatna ding in piak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khat kiang ah Kha in pilna thu a pia hi; midang kiang ah, huai Kha mah in theihna thu a pia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan midang kiang a, huai Kha mah in, ginna a pia hi; midang kiang ah hihdam theihna a pia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midang kiang ah thillamdang hihtheihna, midang kiang ah thugen theihna, midang kiang ah khate theihkak theihna, midang kiang ah pau chi tuamtuamte, midang kiang ah paute hilhchetna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh hiaite tengteng Kha khat leh a kikhat mah in, michih kiang ah a deih bangzel a hawm in a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sapum i chih khat ahi a, hiang a nei a, sapum hiangte tengteng, tam mahle uh, pumpi khat ahi a; Khrist huchibang mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I vek un sapum khat a om ding in Kha khat a baptist in i omta ua, Judate hiam, Grikte hiam, sikhate hiam sikha lou hiam; huan i vek un Kha khat a kipan dawnsak in i omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sapum i chih hiang khat kia hilou in tampi ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khepek in, “Khut ka hihlouh ziak in sapum a pang ka hi kei” chileh, huai thu ziak in sapum a panglou ahi tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan bil in, “Mit ka hih louh ziak in sapum a pang ka hi kei” chileh, huai thu ziak in sapum a panglou ahi tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sapum tengteng mit hi vek leh gingzakna koi ah a om dia? Avek in gingzakna hileh, gimzakna koi ah a om dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in hiang khempeuh sapum ah a utna peuh ah a omsak chiatta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in huai tengteng hiang khat kia hileh sapum pen koi ah a om dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh hiang tampi ahizaw uh, himahleh sapum khat kia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huan mit in, khut kiang ah, “Bangmah in k’on deihkei” a chi theikei; lu in leng khepekte kiang ah, “Bangmah in k’on deihkei” a chi thei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchih naksang in, sapum hiang hat dia kilawmlou pente a kiphamoh zaw mahmah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in sapum hiang pahtawi thamlouh zaw a i sehte, huaite ngei i pahtawi zaw uhi; huan i hiang kilawmloute’n kilawmna thupizaw a mu zel uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I hiang kilawm te’n bel huchibang a hih a kiphamoh kei uhi. Pathian in, kilawmna neilou hiang pahtawi zawk ding in, sapum a lemkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi a sapum a kikhenna omlou a, a hiangte’n kibang tak a a kibuaipih tuah theih zawkna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in hiang khat in a thuak leh hiang tengteng in a thuakpih a, hiang khat pahtawi a a om leh hiang dangte’n a kipahpih zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huchi in noute Khrist Sapum na hi ua, a hiangte na hi chiat lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan Pathian in khenkhat saptuam lak ah a honkoih a, a khatna ah sawltakte, a nihna ah thugenmite, a thumna ah heutute a koih a; huai nung in thillamdang hihte a om a; huai nung in hihdamtheihna thilpiakte, panpih theihna thilpiakte, vaihawm siamna thilpiakte, pautheihlouh chi tuamtuam a thugen theihna thilpiakte a om nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Avek un sawltak ahivek uhia? Avek un thugenmi ahivek uhia? Avek un heutu ahivek uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Avek un thillamdang hihmi ahivek uhia? Avek un hihdam theihna thilpiakte a nei vek uhia? Avek un pautheihlouhte in thu a gen vek uhia? Avek un thu hilhchianmi ahivek uhia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thilpiak thupipente lunggulh mahmah zaw un. Huan lampi hoihsem k’on ensak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing paute leh angel paute in thugen mah leng, itna ka neih kei leh dak ging lel hiam, dakkhutbet ging lel hiam ka hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huan thugen theihna nei in, thuguk tengteng leh theihna tengteng thei vek in, mual suan theihna khop hial ginna kim nei mah leng, itna ka neih kei leh bangmah ka hi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan migentheite vakna ding in ka sum tengteng pevek in, ka pumpi leng kang ding hial in kipe mah leng, itna ka neih kei leh kei ding in bangmah a phatuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Itna in a dohzou a, a migi a; itna in a haza kei a, a kisathei sam kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Itna a kiuangsak kei a, a huham sam kei. Itna in amah thulou thu a salou kei a, amah angsung a khual sam kei; a hehbaih kei a, hehsa in a omden sam kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Itna in gilou a kipahpih kei a, a dik a kipahpih zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Itna in bangkim a thuak teitei a, bangkim a gingta a, bangkim a lamen a, bangkim a thuak khezel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna zaw chikchiang mah in a beikei ding: himahleh, thugennate om mahleh hihtawp a honghi ding a, paute om mahleh a hongtawp ding a, theihnate om mahleh hihtawp a honghi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kimlou in i thei a, a kimlou in thu i gen uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kim a hongtun chiang in a kimlou hihtawp ahita ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka naupan lai in naupang pau in ka pau a, naupang theih in ka thei a, naupang ngaihtuah in ka ngaihtuah hi; tua k’ong pichin nung in naupang hihdan ka tawpsanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin zaw limlang ah i mu milmial ahi, huai hun chiang in zaw kimaituah in ahita ding hi. Tuin zaw a kimlou in ka thei a, himahleh huai hun chiang in zaw theihkhit a ka om bang in ka theikimta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in hiai thumte, ginna, lametna, itna, a om gige ding hi; huaite a a thupipen itna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Itna delh zel unla, khalam thilpiakte leng lunggulh gige un, himahleh thu na gentheihna ding uh lunggulh sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paute a pau in mi kiang a thugen hilou in Pathian kiang a gen ahizaw hi, kuamah in a thugen a theikei a; himahleh kha ah thuguk a gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thugenmi in bel mihing kiang ah bawlhoihna thute, hanthawnna thute, khamuanna thute a gen zawzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paute a pau in amah kia a kibawl hoih a, thugenmin saptuamte a bawlhoih zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan na vek un paute a na pau uh k’on deihsak a, himahleh thu na gen uh k’on deihsak sem hi; saptuamte’n kibawlhoihna a muh theihna ding un a hilhchet nawn kei leh thugenmi zaw paute a pau mi sang in a thupizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin unaute aw, paute a thugen in na kiang uah hongleng, theihsakna lam hiam, thugenna lam hiam, thuhilhna lam hiam na kiang ua ka gen kei ngal leh, bang ahia k’on hih phattuamna ding om?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil hinna neilou, gingtheite leng, tamngai hiam, kaihging hiam, gennei a a ginkei leh, bang la ahia a tum ua a kaih uh bangchi’n a theihtheih dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pengkul gen neilou a a mut un kua galkap din a kisa ding a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in nou leng pautheih baihlama na gen kei uleh bangthu ahia na gen uh bangchi’n a theihtheih dia? Huihkhua a paulel na hi kei ding ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khovel ah pau chi tuamtuam tampi a om tham a, himahleh gen neilou himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pau in a gen ka theih kei leh a genmi ading in kei melmak ka hi ding a; a genmi leng kei ading in melmak ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in noute’n khalam thilpiakte na lunggulh mah bang un saptuam bawlhoihna ding in theihtawp suah in zang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in paute a thugen in a hilhchet theihna din thum hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paute a ka thum leh ka kha in zaw a thum ngei a, ka theihna bel a phatuam tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangchi’n ahita dia le? Kha in ka thum dia, theihna in leng ka thum ding; kha in la ka sa dia, theihna in leng la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichilou in, Kha in vualzawl mahle chin a thei nailoute’n na thugen theilou pi in na kipahthugen uh bangchi’n, Amen, a chithei ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang zaw chihtak in kipahthu na gen hoih a, midang a bawlhoih tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Noumau tengteng sang in paute a thu ka gen tamzawk ziak in Pathian kiang ah kipahthu ka gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh saptuamte kikhopna ah paute a thu sing khat gen sang in midangte ka hilh theihna ding in ka theihtheihna in thumal nga kia gen ka utzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unaute aw, ngaihtuahna ah naupang kei un; himahleh gilou ah zaw naungek unla, lungsim ah piching un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dan laibu ah: “Paute leh gamdang mite muk in, hiai mite kiang ah thu ka gen ding a; huchi in leng a hon ngaikhe tuankei ding uhi, Toupa’n a chi” chih gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiziak in paute zaw gingtate din chiamtehna ahi kei a, gingloute din ahizaw, thugen bel gingloute adin chiamtehna ahi kei a, gingta te ding in ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in saptuam tengteng kikhawm a na vek ua, paute a na pau uleh thei nailoute leh gingloute honglut leh a hai uh honchi kei ding ua hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na vek ua thu na gen uleh ginglou hiam, thei nailou hiam honglut leh a siamlouhdan uh na vek ua ma ah hihlat ahi ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huchi in a lungtang thugukte uh hihlat in a omta ding a, leisi in Pathian a be ding ua, “Pathian na lakuah a omtaktak” chih a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Unaute aw, bangchi ding ahita dia leh? Na hong kikhop un, phatna la hiam, thu kihilh hiam, theihsakna thu hiam, paute, hilhchetna hiam na neichiat zel ua. Bangkim bawlhoihna ding in hih hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kuapeuh in paute a thu a gen uleh, nih in hiam, a tampen in thum in hiam hileh, kikhel zel in leng hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan mi khat in hilhchian hen; hilhchianmi a omkei leh saptuamte kikhopna ah dai in om henla, amah leh Pathian kiang ah gen hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thugenmi in leng nih in hiam, thum in hiam, gen uhenla, midangte’n hoihtak in ngaihtuah uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh a kiang a tu midang kiang a theihsakna thupiak a hongtun leh a masapen dai mai hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi tengteng in a theihtheihna ding leh mi tengteng khamuang a a om theihna ding un, na vek un khatkhat in thu na genthei ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thugenmite khate thugenmite thuthu in a om uh ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian buaina Pathian ahi kei a, lemna Pathian ahizaw hi. Mi Siangthou saptuam pawl tengteng a om bang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Saptuamte kikhopna ah numeite dai dinden in om uhen; amau zaw a thugen uh phal ahi kei a; Dan gen bang in thumang in omzaw uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huan bangpeuh a theihnop uleh inn ah amau pasalte dong uhen; saptuamte kikhopna a numei thugen zaw a zumhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian thu noumau apan pawt ahi maw? Ahihkeileh noumau kiang kia a hongtung ahi maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kuapeuh thugenmi hiam kha mi hiam a kisak leh na kiang ua ka gelh Toupa thupiak ahi chih a theih ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh in a theihkei leh amah leng theih ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huaiziak in unaute aw, thugen lunggulh unla, paute a thugen leng kham kei un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Himahleh bangkim kilawm leh diktak a hih hi hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huaiban ah unaute aw, Tanchinhoih k’on hilhzaw k’on theisaknawn ding a; huai Tanchinhoih na kipahpih ua, huai mah ah na ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />K’on thuhilh pen na mawk gintak uh hilou a, pom kichian na hih uleh huai mah ah hotdam in na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A masapen in ken ka muh sam nou k’on hilhsawn a; huchi a, Khrist Laisiangthou bangbang a i khelhnate ziak a a sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A vui ua, Laisiangthou bangbang a ni thum ni’n kaihthoh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan Kifa kiang ah a kilak a, huaikhit a sawmlehnihte kiang a a kilak thute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaikhit in unau za nga sang a tamzawte kiang ah a kilak nawn a, huaite lak a mi, a tamzaw tutan in a damlai ua, khenkhat bel a ihmuta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaikhit in Jakob leh sawltak tengteng kiang ah a kilak nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huan a tawppen ah, a hunlou bang a piang, keimah kiang ah leng a kilak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei zaw sawltak lak a neupen, Pathian saptuamte ka sawi ziak a sawltak chih tuaklouh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian hehpihna ziak in ka hihhih ka hita; huan a hehpihna honpiak a thawn in a omkei a, huchih naksang in amau tengteng sang in ka semgim zaw hi; himahleh keimah kia in ka sem kei a, Pathian hehpihna ka kiang a om in a sem zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh, ken leng, amau leng huchi in ka gen zel ua, huchi in nou leng na gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Khrist misi lak a kipan kaihthoh in a om chih a honhilh ngal uleh, bangchidan ahia na lak ua khenkhat in, misi thohnawnna himhim a omkei na chih uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misi thohnawnna himhim omlou ahihleh, Khrist leng kaihthoh in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan Khrist kaihthoh a a omkei leh, i thugen uh bangmahlou ahi ding a, na gin uleng bangmahlou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi, Khrist a kaithou chih Pathian i theihpih ziak in, Pathian lam thu ah theihpih zuauthei i honghi ding hi, misite kaihthoh a a omkei uleh, amah leng a kaithou kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Misite kaithoha a omkei un zaw, Khrist leng kaihthoh in a omta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Khrist kaihthoh a a omkei leh, na gin uh bangmahlou ahi ding a, na khelhna uah na om nilouh uh ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi hileh, Khrist a ihmusate a mangthangta uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu damsung kia a Khrist tung a lametna i neih in zaw mi tengteng lak a mi hehpihhuai pen i hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh Khrist misi lak a kipan kaihthoh in a omtaktak ahi, ihmute lak a kipan gahmasa a na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khat ziak a sihna a hongom ziak in mi khat ziak mah in misi thohnawnna leng a hong omta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Adam ah mi tengteng a si mah bang un, Khrist ah mi tengteng hih hin in leng a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh amau hunchiat ah: Khrist gah masapen te ahi a; huaikhit chiang in a hong painawnna ah Khrist a te a thou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in a tawp a hongtung ding; huai hun chiang in, vaihawmna tengteng, thuneihna leh thilhihtheihna tengteng a hihman nung in, Pathian kiang ah, Pa kiang ngei ah gam a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A melmate tengteng a khenuai a a koih masiah aman vaihawm ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Melma nanungpen hihmang a om ding sihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman, “A khenuai ah bangkim a koih hi.” Himahleh “A khe nuai ah bangkim koih in a om” a chih in a nuai a bangkim koihpa a pang kha kei chih a kimu gige ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan a nuai a bangkim koih a a om hun chiang in, Tapa mahmah leng a nuai a koih in a om ding a, Pathian bangkim a bangkim a hih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi ahihkei in, misite ading a baptisma a tansak uh bang a chihna uh hi ding ahia? Misite kaihthoh a a omlou ding a hih uleh bang a chia amau adia baptisma tansak uh ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangziak a eite dakkal chih a sih lauhuai a om i hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Unaute aw, Khrist Jesu i Toupa a k’on suanna sial in ni teng in ka si, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing dan in gen leng Ephesa khua a gamsate kilaipih ka hihleh, kei din bang a phatuam ding? “Misi, kaihthoh a a omkei ding uleh ne in dawn leng a ke, zingchiang a si ding hive hang in.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zekhem in omkei un: “Lawm giloute’n omdan hoih a hihgawp nak uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kizentak in halh unla, thil hihkhial kei un; khenkhat in Pa Pathian theihna himhim na neikei ua huai na zumna ding ua ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Himahleh kuahiam khat in, “Misi bangchi’n kaihthoh ahi ding uh? Sapum bangchibang pu in ahia a hong thoh ding?” a chi ahi ding e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nang, mihai, nang mahmah in na tuh leng, a sih phot kei leh hih hin in a omsam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huan chi na tuh in a sapum hongom ding pen ahi kei a, a tang lel na tuh zawnak, buh tang hiam, chi dang tang hiam ahi thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in amah deih bangbang in sapum a pia a, haichi tang chih kiang ah amau sapum chiat a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sa tengteng sa chi khat ahi kei ua; mihing sa a tuam a, gamsa sa a tuam a, vasa sa a tuam a, ngasa sa a tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Van sapum a om a, lei sapum leng a om hi, himahleh vanlam sapumte thupina a tuam a, leilam sapumte thupina a tuam hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nisa thupina a tuam a, khapi thupina a tuam a, aksite thupina a tuam hi; aksi leh aksi leng a thupina uh a tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Misite thohnawnna leng tua bang ahi. Muatthei a tuh in a om a, muattheilou a kaihthoh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pahtawilouh a tuh in a om a, thupitak a kaihthoh in a om hi. Hatlou a tuh in a om a, thilhihtheihna nei a kaihthoh in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sapum a tuh in a om a, kha pumpi a kaihthoh in a om hi. Sapumpi a om leh kha pumpi leng a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huchi in mi masapen “Adam mihing a honghi a” chi a gelh ahi; Adam nanungpen bel hinna pepa kha a honghi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Himahleh khalam a om masa kei a, salam a omzaw; huai zoh in khalam pen a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mihing masapen lei a siam, leimi ahi a; mihing nihna pen van apan Toupa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lei a siam mihing leimi a hih bang in, van a kipan mi tuh vanmi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huan lei a siam mihing batna i put bang in, van a kipan hong paipa batna leng i pu sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Unaute aw, sa leh sisan in Pathian gam a luah theikei ding a; muatthei in muattheihlouhna a luah sam kei ding chih, ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ngai un, thuguk k’on hilh ding hi! I vek un i ihmu kholkei ding ua, himahleh i vek un pengkul nanungpen gin a chiang in, sawtloukal in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Mitphiatkal lou in hihlamdan in i om vekta ding; pengkul ging ding ahi ngal a, huchi in misite muattheilou a kaihthoh in a om ding ua, eite leng hihlamdan in i omta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hiai muatthei in muattheihlouhna a silh ding ahi a, hiai sithei in leng sihtheihlouhna a silh sam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Huchi a hiai muatthei in muattheihlouhna a silh a, hiai sithei in sihtheihlouhna a silh hun chiang in, huai hun ngeingei in, “Zohna in sihna a valh zouta” chih thugelh a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Aw sihna, na gu koi a omta ahia? Aw han, na zohna koi a omta ahia?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Sihna gu khelhna ahi a; khelhna thilhihtheihna dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Himahleh i Toupa Jesu Khrist ziak a zohna hon pepa Pathian kiang ah kipahthu om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka unau deihtakte aw, kiptak in, hihlin vuallouh in, Toupa nasep phatuamngaitak a sem gige in om un, na sepgimna uh Toupa ah a thawn ngeikei chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan misiangthoute adia thohlawm thu zaw, Galatia gam a saptuam pawlte kiang a thu ka piak bang in nou leng na hih sam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni sagih ni masapen in michih in vualzawlna na muh bangzel un koih khawl chiat unla; ka hong chiang a thohlawm lakkhawm himhim a om louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan na hehpih thilpiak uh Jerusalem khua a hohpih ding in ka hongtun chiang in kuapeuh hoih na chih ua lai na piak uh ka sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan kei vahoh kilawm ahihleh, kei toh a hoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan Masidonia gam ka totsuah khit chiang in na kiang uah ka hong ding a; Masidonia gam lah ka tuansuak himhim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nou kiang ah bang tan hiam, phalbi sungteng houh ka tam nilouh kha diam, ka hohna ding peuh ah noute’n n’on khaksawn theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua paikawm lel a honmuh malam ka ut kei a, Toupa’n lem a sakleh na kiang ua sawtsim tam ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Pentikost ni tan in Ephesa khua ah ka tam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kong lianpi, phatuampi sepna ding kei adin a kihong ngal a; huan doumite leng tampi a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Timothi a hongtun leh lauthawng lou a na kiang ua a omna ding in pilvang un; ken ka sep bangmah in Toupa nna a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in kuamah in musit kei uhen; ka kiang a a hong theihna ding in khamuangtak in khakhia unla; unaute toh amah muh ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I unaupa Apollos thu zaw, unaute toh na kiang ua hong ding in ka deih ngial hi, himahleh tun zaw hong a utkei a; a lemtan hun chiang in a hongding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kiveng unla, ginna ah ding kip unla, kihihhang unla, hattak in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hih peuhmah uh itna a hih hivek hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaute aw, Stephena inkuanpihte zaw Akhaia gam a gingta masate ahi ua, misiangthoute na sem ding in a kipia uh chih na thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchibang mite kiang ah leh, nasep a panpih leh, semgim peuhte kiang a lut ding in k’on hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan Stephenas, Fortunate, leh Akaikas a hongtun uh ka kipak hi, noute hihlouh langlou a ka taksapna hon huh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau ka lungsim leh na lungsim uh hon hihhalh ua, hichibang mite zaw kipahpih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia gam a saptuam pawlte’n chibai honbuk uhi. Akuila, Priscilla leh a inn ua om saptuamte’n deihsaktakin Toupa ah chibai honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Unau tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi. Tawp siangthou in chibai kibuk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kei Paul in hiai chibai bukna keimah khut mahmah a ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kuapeuh in Toupa Jesu Khrist a itkei leh hamse thuak in om hen. I Toupa a hongpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a ka itna na vek ua lak ah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
